        {
          "id": 754911254,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Tested randpktdump using `WIRESHARK_LOG_LEVEL=debug ./run/wireshark` and it didn't regress with debug information reported as errors in the GUI.\n\nThe reason is that levels <= Info are now written to stdout instead of stderr. This works and matches the original implementation but it could be a lot cleaner.",
          "author": {
            "id": 2639362,
            "username": "jvalverde",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "João Valverde",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
