          "id": 755369453,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I checked it and doesn't work well. My understanding was you will just rename parameters and set debug if log level is debug or higher, but I see more changes.\n\nI see misbehaving:\n\n`./run/extcap/randpktdump --extcap-interface=randpkt --type dns --count 10 --fifo=FILENAME --capture --log-level=debug --log-file=/tmp/abc`\n\nshould log to /tmp/abc only, but it log same output to console and to the file.",
